<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS SELL 61.87 MLN RAND S.AFRICA BONDS THUR.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS SELL 61.87 MLN RAND S.AFRICA BONDS THUR.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 61.87 million rand worth of South African bonds on Thursday after selling a net 111.66 million rand on Wednesday, the Bond Exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27</p>
</text>
